{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc97Bliss Apartment\ud83d\udc97</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist, once a rich second-generation heir of the &quot;Aosagi Group,&quot; witnesses the malicious acquisition of his family business by the rival &quot;Hakuryu Group,&quot; Shortly after, his father passes away, and he himself is involved in a mysterious car accident. With a small amount of money and a property deed from a past investment, he sets out on a path of revenge with his most trusted secretary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He will now manage businesses related to &quot;pleasure venues&quot; in his own way, getting close to and &quot;entertaining&quot; tenants who are directly or indirectly tied to the &quot;Hakuryu Group,&quot; responsible for the destruction of his family.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25c6 Interact with characters to increase intimacy, unlocking more system features as intimacy reaches certain levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25c6 Methods to increase intimacy include chatting, gifting, dating, and training, among other interactive activities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25c6 Along the way, players can trigger different events and stories, adding to the game's entertainment value.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Greeting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146080/extras/01-en-\u6253\u62db\u547c.gif?t=1747361824\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146080/extras/02-en-\u9001\u79ae.gif?t=1747361824\" /></div></